<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></TXT><BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Profile Wall PE Pipe</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM F894</RID>, RSC 160, produced from PE certified by the resin producer as meeting the requirements of <RID>ASTM D3350</RID>, minimum cell class 334433C.  Provide 
pipe with pipe walls having the following properties:</TXT><BRK/>
<TXT><TAB HEADERROWS="2">
